      "id": 10370,
      "name": "Spiff",
      "username": "Spiff",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/{size}/1865_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-05-23T15:38:53.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I don't have the game yet, obviously, but many of the reviews complain about how much time is spent checking cards for effects which trigger during each of the phases of the game. &nbsp;I plan on using these tokens to mark cards with phase-triggered effects, similar to the ones I use while playing SotM. &nbsp;Having these types of tokens standing up off the cards in my SotM games really helps me keep track of what each card is doing, and I think they'll help in GSF as well. &nbsp;If you think they'd help you, <a href=\"http://www.spiffworld.com/gsf/files/triba_tokens.pdf\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">feel free to grab the file</a>.</p><p><a href=\"http://www.spiffworld.com/gsf/images/triba_tokens.jpg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><span alt=\"TRIBA tokens\" class=\"broken-image\" title=\"This image is broken\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-unlink svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#unlink\"></use></svg></span></a></p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
